1521082.steps:
1. Policy \ Rules and Policies \ DNS Rules, Clear all DNS policies;
2. Top add and enable a policy named Test, Action-Filter, Zone-LAN, Address-X0 Subnet, Service-DNS UDP;
3. Rules and Policies \ Access Rules, check the Access Rules;
4. Disable the DNS policy "Test", check the Access Rules;
5. Change the name and action, but the other configurations keep same as Test, add enabled the DNS proxy Policy, check the Access Rules;
6. Disable the enabled DNS proxy policy, check the Access Rules.

